==============================================================================
S662 pi trinity: infinite sum, infinite product, infinite fraction
==============================================================================

Core formulas
  sum       pi/4 = sum_{k>=0} (-1)^k/(2k+1)
  sum-fast  pi/4 = 4*atan(1/5) - atan(1/239), with atan by power series
  sum       pi^2/6 = sum_{n>=1} 1/n^2
  product   pi/2 = product_{n>=1} (2n)^2/((2n-1)(2n+1))
  fraction  4/pi = 1 + 1^2/(2 + 3^2/(2 + 5^2/(2 + ...)))

